<title>FRANCE: Bouygues has telecoms connection deal.</title>
<headline>Bouygues has telecoms connection deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bouygues Telecom has signed an interconnection deal with France Telecom and is talking to banks about raise 15 billion francs for its mobile telephone infrastructure, managing director Patrick Leleu told the newspaper La Tribune.</p>
<p>The total cost of the infrastructure for mobile telephones was put at 23 billion francs, of which eight billion will be paid by shareholders of Bouygues Telecom.</p>
</text>
